uld not happen, I think, because the CI does that :thinking:. But without more details on exactly what you did and what compilation errors you have, it's difficult to help more", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1345342200/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1345353688", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1941#issuecomment-1345353688", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1941", "id": 1345353688, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5QMHfY", "user": {"login": "luketjones99", "id": 86388538, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg2Mzg4NTM4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86388538?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99", "html_url": "https://github.com/luketjones99", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-12-10T18:17:10Z", "updated_at": "2022-12-10T18:17:10Z", "body": "I was following the instructions on this quickstart guide: https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/quickstart.html. I just cloned the latest version of the repository and get all the PX4 sim stuff setup separately then I cd into the examples directory and run:\r\n\r\ncd takeoff_and_land/\r\ncmake -Bbuild -H.\r\ncmake --build build -j4\r\n\r\nThe first cmake call runs properly, but the second one results in the following errors:\r\n\r\n error: no type named 'NewSystemHandle' in 'mavsdk::Mavsdk'\r\n    Mavsdk::NewSystemHandle handle = mavsdk.subscribe_on_new_system([&mavsdk, &prom, &handle]() {\r\n    ~~~~~~~~^\r\n error: no member named 'unsubscribe_on_new_system' in 'mavsdk::Mavsdk'; did you mean 'subscribe_on_new_system'?\r\n            mavsdk.unsubscribe_on_new_system(handle);\r\n                   ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n                   subscribe_on_new_system\r\n/usr/local/include/mavsdk/mavsdk.h:301:10: note: 'subscribe_on_new_system' declared here\r\n    void subscribe_on_new_system(const NewSystemCallback& callback);\r\n         ^\r\n\r\nI was able to get everything running by switching to an old branch and then re running the cmake lines, and then running:\r\n\r\nbuild/takeoff_and_land udp://:14540\r\n\r\nBut, I figured if I was having to switch to an old branch to get something working, then I was doing something wrong.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1345353688/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "luketjones99", "id": 86388538, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg2Mzg4NTM4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86388538?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99", "html_url": "https://github.com/luketjones99", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/luketjones99/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1346479560", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1941#issuecomment-1346479560", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1941", "id": 1346479560, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5QQaXI", "user